420 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 344 0 R
/E (Students struggle to understand abstract STEM concepts because they cannot see or interact with them in real life. Many existing digital learning tools only allow passive viewing, which can lead to boredom and low knowledge retention. As a result, students may lose interest in science at an early stage. This can impact society by reducing the number of students pursuing STEM fields in the future and widening the gap between those who have access to engaging learning tools and those who do not.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
