/T (Our proposed solution is a multimodal AR storytelling system that helps primary school students learn complex STEM concepts through a unified "Action-Talk-Test-Play" cycle)
/E (Our proposed solution is a multimodal AR storytelling system that helps primary school students learn complex STEM concepts through a unified "Action-Talk-Test-Play" cycle)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
425 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 346 0 R
/E (Our solution allows students to interact with STEM concepts through hand gestures embedded in a story. Unlike existing AR tools, which mostly let students look at models or answer quizzes, our system turns learning into an active, hands-on experience. It also provides feedback and narrative progression, keeping students engaged and helping them understand the concepts deeply)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
